  id: work.cook
  displayName: Show Me Your Kitchen
  description: 'Yrsa cooked for a jarl once, and tells you so. Speak to her, give her the Cook''s work and build a Kitchen ({key:Build}): her meals last, and send you out stronger. It wants Bjarne''s Smithy standing, for the pots.'
  chain: Yrsa
  journalNotes: The Kitchen wants Bjarne's Smithy standing first. Yrsa's meals give their bonuses for longer than a stew from the campfire, and she will tell you which jarl she cooked them for.
